  "critical": false,
  "description": "Centrifugal separation of solids from liquids (or two immiscible liquids) by applying centrifugal force 500-15,000x gravity. Three configurations: disc-stack (fine particles, liquid-liquid), basket (batch, coarser particles), and decanter (continuous, high-solids slurries). Enables rapid clarification, catalyst recovery, and crystal harvesting that gravity settling cannot achieve economically.",
